of arrested motion.

01:06:33.927 --> 01:06:43.408
Smooth brown side twisted
to light a cigarette.

01:06:47.400 --> 01:07:00.374
He stood there in a 1920s
straw hat somebody gave him.

01:07:00.374 --> 01:07:13.348
Soft, mendicant words
falling like dead birds

01:07:13.348 --> 01:07:18.338
in the dark street.

01:07:25.324 --> 01:07:26.322
No.

01:07:26.322 --> 01:07:28.817
No more.

01:07:28.817 --> 01:07:29.815
No más.

01:07:34.306 --> 01:07:54.266
A heaving sea of air hammers
in the purple brown dusk

01:07:54.266 --> 01:08:04.745
tainted with rotten
metal smell of sewer gas.

01:08:07.739 --> 01:08:23.011
Young worker faces
vibrating out of focus

01:08:23.011 --> 01:08:29.472
in yellow halos of
carbide lanterns.

01:08:33.945 --> 01:08:37.424
Broken pipes exposed.

01:08:47.861 --> 01:09:02.771
"They are rebuilding the
" Lee nodded absently.

