01:11:05.900 --> 01:11:16.517
"BEFORE LIFE AND AFTER"]

01:11:16.517 --> 01:11:24.501
VOCALIST (SINGING): A time
there was, as one may guess.

01:11:24.501 --> 01:11:32.158
And as, indeed, earth's
testimonies tell.

01:11:37.647 --> 01:11:48.126
Before the birth
of consciousness,

01:11:48.126 --> 01:11:54.114
when all went well.

01:12:11.080 --> 01:12:19.563
None suffered sickness,
love, or loss.

01:12:19.563 --> 01:12:27.048
None knew regret, starved
hope, or a heart-burnings.

01:12:41.020 --> 01:12:48.505
None cared whatever crash or
cross brought wrack to things.

01:13:05.471 --> 01:13:11.459
If something ceased,
no tongue bewailed.

01:13:11.459 --> 01:13:21.439
If something winced and
waned, no heart was wrung.

01:13:30.920 --> 01:13:43.878
If brightness dimmed, and dark
prevailed, no sense was stung.

01:13:52.344 --> 01:14:00.810
But the disease of feeling
germed and primal rightness

01:14:00.810 --> 01:14:04.296
took the tinct of wrong.

01:14:08.280 --> 01:14:14.256
Ere nescience shall
be reaffirmed.

01:14:18.240 --> 01:14:37.164
How long, how long?

01:14:48.618 --> 01:14:52.602
[APPLAUSE]

